WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.525
Step one of our problem: departure and course.

2
00:00:03.775 --> 00:00:05.625
Follow the diagram.

3
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:09.400
At seven hundred, you depart from a charted buoy.

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:15.875
The first question asks for its position, and you read the latitude and longitude from the scales.

5
00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:18.850
Next, lay the course to the next mark.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.725
The rulers read zero six eight true.

7
00:00:21.975 --> 00:00:26.825
The question gives you variation fifteen west and deviation two east.

8
00:00:27.075 --> 00:00:30.650
Going from true toward compass, what do you do with each?

9
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.875
Add west, subtract east.

10
00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:37.375
Zero six eight, plus fifteen, minus two.

11
00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:39.800
Zero eight one, compass.

12
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.875
The leg measures nine point six miles.

13
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:48.950
At twelve knots, sixty times nine point six divided by twelve is forty-eight minutes.

14
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.975
So your estimated time of arrival is seven forty-eight.
